<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa to sign Lome accesion, official says.</title>
<headline>S.Africa to sign Lome accesion, official says.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa is due to sign an accession agreement to the Lome Convention later on Thursday in Luxembourg, a senior Department of Trade and Industry official said.</p>
</text>
